  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# New transitions\n\n## Int transitions\n\nThe `IntTransition` handles transitions that accept a whole number as a token. \nIt allows to provide a bunch of acceptable integer as once, from collections or defined as intervals. \n\n```csharp\nusing Nt.Automaton.Transitions.Integers;\n\nvar target = new State();\nvar transition = new IntTransition(target).Include(1, 10);\n```\n\nSee the [documentation about integer transitions](Doc/Transitions.md#integer-transitions) for more information about the `IntTransition` class.\n\n## String transitions\n\nThe `StringTransition` handles transitions that accept a string as a token.\nIt allows to provide a bunch of acceptable strings as once, from collections or following a pattern.\n\n```csharp\nusing Nt.Automaton.Transitions.Strings;\n\nvar target = new State();\nvar transition = new StringTransition(target).AddPattern(@\"[a-zA-Z0-9]+\");\n```\n\nSee the [documentation about string transitions](Doc/Transitions.md#string-transitions) for more information about the `StringTransition` class.\n\n# Bug and documentation fixes\n- Fix not being able to override the `Read`, `Activate`, and `Deactivate` methods of a state.\n- Fix not being able to override the `Accepts` and `Trigger` methods of a transition.\n- Write more precise documentation about overriding states and transitions.",
